    "bodyPlain": "Biteship di Detail Sales Seri: Pengiriman (halaman 2 dari 4) URL staff: → sidebar Pengiriman / panel Biteship --- Kapan panel muncul? Sale paid (atau setelah booking) dengan item yang: - Metode pengiriman terhubung Biteship ( + service) - Order Biteship sudah terbentuk (auto saat paid atau manual) Komponen FE: , --- Aksi staff (UI) Tombol / aksi Fungsi --------------- -------- Request pickup Booking pickup kurir ke alamat asal Drop-off Counter drop-off (jika layanan mendukung) Reschedule pickup Ubah jadwal pickup Tracking Status + riwayat scan POD Proof of delivery (foto/tanda terima) bila tersedia dari API Setelah pickup berhasil / drop-off terdeteksi, UI menyesuaikan (mis. sembunyikan tombol pickup duplikat). --- Consolidated order (Jul 2026) Satu invoice dengan beberapa item Biteship → backend membuat satu order / satu resi (bukan per SKU). Aturan Detail -------- -------- Kurir Semua item harus courier + service sama Booking — multi-baris ke Biteship Metadata (consolidated, waybill, mode) Rollback Env → perilaku lama per-item UI staff (Fase 3): invoice multi-item dengan resi sama → satu panel tracking di detail sales ( ). Sale lama multi-resi tetap tampil per item. Checkout marketplace (Fase 2): satu pilihan kurir + satu ongkir per order — Jul 2026. Auto split paket (Fase 4): jika total berat melebihi limit → beberapa order Biteship; ongkir checkout = jumlah tarif per paket. Config Detail -------- -------- Limit berat (gram), default 30000 (30 kg) Nonaktif Set atau env Override env Booking N order ( suffix , ), metadata UI staff Panel Paket 1/2 per resi jika split --- Alur backend 1. Paid sale → optional auto-booking ( , default on di env lama) 2. Request pickup → (via controller) 3. Webhook / poll → update tracking snapshot di sale item 4. Delivery status sync → mapping status Biteship → Kolam File penting: Path Peran ------ ------ Rates, order, pickup, POD Logic pickup (dipakai DARA autopilot juga) Map status Route API --- Integrasi DARA Autopilot Autopilot webstore dapat memanggil request pickup otomatis setelah: - Packing selesai (SIAP di Team Chat) - Customer grant consent kirim - Item memenuhi Lihat /bantuan/dara-cs-09-fulfillment-pengiriman --- Troubleshooting Gejala Cek -------- ----- Tombol pickup tidak muncul Item punya metode Biteship? Sale paid? Pickup gagal API key Biteship, pinpoint asal toko Tracking stale Cron poll Biteship; webhook Instant tidak bisa book Koordinat asal + tujuan wajib --- Env ← Ringkasan · Marketplace timeline →"
